							<li><strong>Tuition Fee (per semester):</strong> [PLACEHOLDER ₹XXXX]</li>
							<li><strong>Merit-based scholarships:</strong> [PLACEHOLDER details]</li>
							<li><strong>Need-based financial aid:</strong> [PLACEHOLDER details]</li>
							<li><strong>State scholarships (if applicable):</strong> [PLACEHOLDER details]</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<div class="program-section">
