					<div class="program-section">
						<h3>Required Documents</h3>
						<ul>
							<li>[PLACEHOLDER] Valid photo ID</li>
							<li>[PLACEHOLDER] Passport-sized photograph (4x6 cm)</li>
							<li>[PLACEHOLDER] 10+2 marksheet and certificate</li>
							<li>[PLACEHOLDER] Transfer certificate from last school</li>
							<li>[PLACEHOLDER] Character certificate</li>
