						</ul>
					</div>

					<div class="program-section">
						<h3>Contact & Support</h3>
						<ul>
							<li><strong>Integrated Program Coordinator:</strong> [PLACEHOLDER name, email, phone]</li>
							<li><strong>Department Academic Advisor:</strong> [PLACEHOLDER contact]</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Integrated B.Sc-B.Ed Tab -->
				<div class="tab-content" id="integrated-bscbed">
					<div class="program-section">
						<h3>Program Overview</h3>
						<ul>
							<li><strong>Degree Awarded:</strong> B.Sc. + B.Ed. in Physics (integrated teacher-training pathway)</li>
							<li><strong>Duration:</strong> [PLACEHOLDER — 5 years / 10 semesters]</li>
